Deng&ecirc; Amer&icirc;ka her roj s
&ecirc;
caran bernamey&ecirc;n bi ziman&ecirc; Kurd&icirc; belav diket. Her bernameyeke radyoy&ecirc; bi dir&ecirc;j&icirc;ya seetek&ecirc; ye. Hun dikarin li v&ecirc; rupel&ecirc; guhdar&icirc;ya bernameyen me y&ecirc;n v&ecirc; heft&icirc;y&ecirc; biken.

